Task: Update the triage guidance based on entries classified as triage failures or successes.

The output MUST have exactly three sections with these headings:

## Known Benign
Patterns the triage tool should NOT flag (confirmed noise).
- If the classification shows the triage flagged something that was actually benign noise
  and distracted the agent, add it here.
- Maximum 10 items.

## Required Checks
Checks to always run even if everything looks healthy.
- If the classification shows the triage missed a resource type or check that turned out
  to be the root cause, add it here.
- Maximum 10 items.

## Anomaly Hints
Anomaly patterns worth flagging.
- If the classification shows a new anomaly shape that the triage should have caught, add it.
- Maximum 15 items.

Rules:
- Each item must be generic (no app-specific names or values).
- Merge near-duplicates. Remove items contradicted by new evidence.
- Preserve items that were not implicated — do not remove working guidance.
- Output only the three sections with their items, no preamble or commentary.
